    "description": "DRAMB is a tokenized certificate issued by BTECH Holdings Limited (ADGM) that provides economic exposure to Roundhill Memory ETF. Roundhill Memory ETF provides thematic exposure to global companies engaged in the memory semiconductor industry, including DRAM and NAND flash memory manufacturers. Each token is backed 1 to 1 by a corresponding ETF unit held in a segregated custody account with a regulated custodian under ADGM FSRA Ledger-Based Securities rules. DRAMB is admitted to the ADGM Official List of Securities. Convertibility to real units is available via the Binance-affiliated broker-dealer Nest Trading Limited, and distribution value is delivered through an on-chain Multiplier rebasing mechanism at the bStocks framework level. Aggregate proof of collateral is published on the Binance Proof of Collateral dashboard covering the entire bStocks family. Access is restricted from United States persons.",
